{
  "prompt": "A well-organized, professional educational poster for 'Rubrics for CA3'. The poster is divided into blocks with clear headings and colorful sections. At the top, a centered title 'Rubrics for CA3: Understand the Criteria to Excel!'. Below, two side-by-side sections: 'Thinking Ability (6 marks)' and 'Creativity & Representation (4 marks)'. Each section has three colored blocks: Green for Excellent, Yellow for Good, Red for Needs Improvement. Each block contains the criteria text: Excellent for Thinking Ability says 'Ideas provide a complete picture with a high degree of imagination and creativity, and submitted on time.'; Good says 'Some ideas radiate out from the center with creativity, but submitted not on time.'; Needs Improvement says 'Not very clear in concepts.' Similarly, for Creativity section, Excellent says 'Conceptual accuracy, visual clarity, creativity, and submission on time.'; Good says 'Partial conceptual accuracy and visual clarity, creativity, and submitted not on time.'; Needs Improvement says 'Not very clear in concepts.' Footer reads '!!! Best of Luck !!!' in a cheerful font. Clean white background, clear fonts, with icons for creativity, accuracy, and timeliness next to the text.",
  "size": "1024x1024"
}

{
  "prompt": "A clean, professional educational poster titled 'Rubrics for CA3'. The poster is divided into clear blocks. Top block: Title 'Rubrics for CA3' in bold, elegant font. Below it, two side-by-side sections. Left section titled 'Thinking Ability (6 marks)', with three blocks: Excellent (Ideas provide a complete picture with high imagination, creativity, and submitted on time), Good (Some ideas radiate from the center with creativity, but not submitted on time), Needs Improvement (Not very clear in concepts). Right section titled 'Creativity & Representation (4 marks)', with three blocks: Excellent (Conceptual accuracy, visual clarity, creativity, and submitted on time), Good (Partial conceptual accuracy and visual clarity, creativity, but not submitted on time), Needs Improvement (Not very clear in concepts). Color scheme: Green for Excellent, Yellow for Good, Red for Needs Improvement. Footer: '!!! Best of Luck !!!' centered. Clean layout, educational design, suitable for printing or digital presentation.",
  "size": "1024x1024"
}
